<.styles />
<.app_nav active={:animals} detail />
<.topbar back={~p"/"} back_label="Animals" title="Siri voice log" />

<style>
  .vl-note { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 16px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed; background: var(--surface); }
  .vl-note + .vl-note { margin-top: 10px; }
  .vl-when { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text3); font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .vl-when [class^="hero-"] { width: 15px; height: 15px; color: #7c3aed; }
  .vl-text { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .vl-animal { font-weight: 800; color: var(--text); }
  .vl-pick { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .vl-pick button { min-height: 40px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface); color: var(--text); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .vl-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .vl-actions .tr-btn-primary { background: #7c3aed; border-color: #7c3aed; flex: 1; }
  .vl-empty { text-align: center; padding: 22px 8px; }
  .vl-empty [class^="hero-"] { width: 34px; height: 34px; color: #7c3aed; }
  .vl-steps { list-style: decimal; margin: 0; padding-left: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .vl-steps li::marker { font-weight: 800; color: #7c3aed; }
  .vl-steps b { font-weight: 700; }
  .vl-steps ul { list-style: disc; margin: 6px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .vl-copy { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .vl-copy input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface2); color: var(--text); font: 600 14px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .vl-key-new { padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: color-mix(in srgb, #7c3aed 10%, var(--surface)); border: 1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb, #7c3aed 40%, var(--border)); }
  .vl-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 6px; }
  .vl-h { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .vl-h [class^="hero-"] { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #7c3aed; }
  code.vl-code { font: 600 13px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
</style>

<div class="tr-wrap">
  <div class="tr-card" id="voice-inbox">
    <h2 class="vl-h"><.icon name="hero-microphone" /> To check</h2>
    <p class="tr-muted" style="margin-bottom:12px">
      What you told Siri. Nothing is saved as a record until you check it.
    </p>

    <div :if={@notes == []} class="vl-empty" id="voice-empty">
      <.icon name="hero-microphone" />
      <p class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:6px">
        Nothing waiting. Say <b>"Hey Siri, Ranch log"</b> and tell it what you did.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div :for={note <- @notes} class="vl-note" id={"note-#{note.id}"}>
      <div class="vl-when">
        <.icon name="hero-microphone" /> {said_at(note.inserted_at)}
        <span :if={note.animal}>· <span class="vl-animal">{note.animal.name}</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="vl-text">"{note.text}"</div>

      <%= if note.animal do %>
        <div :if={@is_superuser} class="vl-actions">
          <a
            class="tr-btn tr-btn-primary"
            href={~p"/animals/#{note.animal_id}?voice=#{note.id}"}
            id={"review-#{note.id}"}
          >
            <.icon name="hero-check-circle" /> Check &amp; save
          </a>
          <button
            class="tr-btn"
            phx-click="dismiss"
            phx-value-note={note.id}
            data-confirm="Dismiss this note without saving?"
          >
            Dismiss
          </button>
        </div>
      <% else %>
        <div :if={@is_superuser}>
          <div class="vl-sub" style="margin:0 0 6px">Which animal was this?</div>
          <div class="vl-pick">
            <button
              :for={a <- @animals}
              type="button"
              phx-click="set_animal"
              phx-value-note={note.id}
              phx-value-animal={a.id}
            >
              {a.name}
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="vl-actions" style="margin-top:10px">
            <button
              class="tr-btn tr-btn-small"
              phx-click="dismiss"
              phx-value-note={note.id}
              data-confirm="Dismiss this note without saving?"
            >
              Dismiss
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div :if={@is_superuser} class="tr-card" id="voice-setup" style="margin-top:14px">
    <h2 class="vl-h"><.icon name="hero-cog-6-tooth" /> Set up "Hey Siri, Ranch log"</h2>
    <p class="tr-muted" style="margin-bottom:14px">
      One time, on your iPhone. After that, say <b>"Hey Siri, Ranch log"</b>, then something like
      <i>"Dewormed Asher with Panacur, day 1 of 5."</i>
      Siri saves it here for you to check later.
    </p>

    <ol class="vl-steps">
      <li>
        <b>Let the Shortcut past Cloudflare.</b>
        In the Cloudflare dashboard, go to Zero Trust:
        <ul>
          <li>
            <b>Access → Service credentials → Service Tokens → Create</b>. Name it <i>Ranch Siri</i>. Copy the
            <b>Client ID</b>
            and <b>Client Secret</b>. The secret is shown only once.
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Access → Applications</b>, open the ranch app, then <b>Policies → Add a policy</b>. Set Action to
            <b>Service Auth</b>
            and Include to <b>Service Token: Ranch Siri</b>. Save.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Make the app key.</b>
        <%= cond do %>
          <% @new_key -> %>
            <div class="vl-key-new" style="margin-top:8px" id="new-key">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Your key. Copy it now; it won't be shown again.</div>
              <div class="vl-copy">
                <input id="key-value" type="text" readonly value={"Bearer #{@new_key}"} />
                <button
                  class="tr-btn tr-btn-small"
                  id="copy-key"
                  phx-click={JS.dispatch("ranch:copy", detail: %{from: "#key-value"})}
                >
                  Copy
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          <% @key_made -> %>
            <div class="vl-sub">
              Key made {local_day(@key_made)}.
              Making a new one turns the old one off.
            </div>
            <div class="vl-actions" style="margin-top:8px">
              <button
                class="tr-btn tr-btn-small"
                phx-click="make_key"
                id="make-key"
                data-confirm="Make a new key? The Shortcut will need the new one."
              >
                Make a new key
              </button>
              <button
                class="tr-btn tr-btn-small"
                phx-click="turn_off_key"
                data-confirm="Turn off the key? The Shortcut stops working until you make a new one."
              >
                Turn off
              </button>
            </div>
          <% true -> %>
            <div class="vl-actions" style="margin-top:8px">
              <button class="tr-btn tr-btn-primary" phx-click="make_key" id="make-key">
                Make a key
              </button>
            </div>
        <% end %>
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Build the Shortcut.</b>
        Open the <b>Shortcuts</b>
        app, tap <b>+</b>, and name it <b>Ranch log</b>. Then add these actions in order:
        <ul>
          <li><b>Dictate Text</b>. Set Stop Listening to <i>After Pause</i>.</li>
          <li>
            <b>Get Contents of URL</b>, with this URL:
            <div class="vl-copy">
              <input id="api-url" type="text" readonly value={url(~p"/api/voice-log")} />
              <button
                class="tr-btn tr-btn-small"
                phx-click={JS.dispatch("ranch:copy", detail: %{from: "#api-url"})}
              >
                Copy
              </button>
            </div>
            Tap the arrow to show more and set Method to <b>POST</b>. Add three <b>Headers</b>:
            <ul>
              <li>
                <code class="vl-code">Authorization</code>: your key from step 2 (it starts with <i>Bearer rk_</i>)
              </li>
              <li><code class="vl-code">CF-Access-Client-Id</code>: the Client ID from step 1</li>
              <li>
                <code class="vl-code">CF-Access-Client-Secret</code>: the Client Secret from step 1
              </li>
            </ul>
            Set Request Body to <b>JSON</b>
            and add a <b>Text</b>
            field: key <code class="vl-code">text</code>, value the <i>Dictated Text</i>
            variable.
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Get Dictionary Value</b>: get the value for <code class="vl-code">message</code>
            in <i>Contents of URL</i>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Speak Text</b>: the <i>Dictionary Value</i>. This way Siri tells you it was saved.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Try it:</b> say "Hey Siri, Ranch log." The note shows up at the top of this page.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>
